The folder PNGs in this directory are from the Yaru icon theme
(https://github.com/ubuntu/yaru), taken from the `Yaru-purple` variant at
48x48@2x. They are the same artwork the desktop file manager shows, so a
directory looks the same in adbshare as it does everywhere else.

