licence: they remain CC-BY-SA-4.0. They are aggregated alongside the code
rather than merged into it, so distributing this directory does not place the
rest of adbshare under ShareAlike. If that is not the intent, replace this
directory with artwork of your own; `names::folders` in `src/icons.rs` is the
only thing that names these files.

Why PNG and not SVG: gpui 0.2's `svg()` renders with usvg and then keeps only
the alpha channel, tinting the silhouette with a single colour. These are
filled, so as SVG they would come out as flat blobs. `img()` keeps the pixels.
